      "value": "@{5c075935d5cece4df39f010f|full_name}: i actually did do that in the past but the only problem i faced is that the vehicle would slightly move while walking or move unrealistically after a second of stopping. ive seen people with vehicles that claimed that the f keys worked for them and didn't face any issues explained above. perhaps there might be something that im not doing correctly to get around that but otherwise this feature should be enabled regardless of the avatar.",
