      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cd7c2a30c26d649a5ab735b|full_name}: All my tanks have that strange behavior and I did manage to cut down on it quite a bit by making the rig the smallest possible size I could without breaking the menu (0.2). Still slides when I look up and down but it doesn't jiggle or do a major wobble when it stops. I think the people who say they got it to work are doing the same thing as us but somehow overcame the shaking issue maybe by a special walking/idle animation.",
