  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "ive modeled cars in the past and still do. at some point wanted to use the f keys for the hazard lights, toggle fog lights, open doors and more. ive tried doing so until i eventually found out that this feature isn't available on non humanoid avatars. it would be really cool if this feature was not only available to humanoid avatars but for those that are non humanoid.",
